      official, un-publicized build, the one the game actually loads. Compiling against
      publicized_assemblies\Assembly-CSharp-Publicized.dll would hide every private access
      that throws FieldAccessException at run time. Non-public members go through
      ModUtil.Reflect instead.
    -->
